 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Roughly half of people keep food in their tent, and the other half keep it in a bear bag hanging outside the tent. Which do you hear more of? Outside the tent, so it' not in the bear's scent trail. Most bear bags hang from a loop on the tent wall, so it's easy without being too low. Make a big noise, yell and wave, and keep away from the food. Bears are usually scared off by loud noises. If you do see a bear, and it' coming closer, stand up, wave, and yell as loud as you can. Bears usually stop and run away after a few loud yells.",
